+    *   **Render:** Project Gaussians to 2D, sort by depth, and rasterize using alpha blending to produce a predicted image $\hat{I}$ [S9, unofficial].
+    *   **Loss Computation:** Compute the loss $\mathcal{L}$ between $\hat{I}$ and the ground truth image $I_{gt}$ [S9, unofficial].
